	Letting n9 denote an arbitrary integer
    x = arcsin((1/4)) * -1 ^ n9 + 180 * n9
     (by Isolation)

Answer is : 
(X1 # X2)
  where :
    X1 =  x = 45 + 90 * n8
    X2 =  x = 180 * n9 + -1 ^ n9 * arcsin((1/4))


